<title>MAURITIUS: SOCCER-MAURITIUS SCOUTS BEAT REUNION SIDE IN AFRICA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MAURITIUS SCOUTS BEAT REUNION SIDE IN AFRICA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CUREPIPE, Mauritius 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mauritius Scouts FC beat St Louisienne of Reunion Island 2-1 (half time 1-1) in their first-round, first-leg African Cup Winners' Cup soccer match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scouts - Youssuf Hossany (11), Robert Rateau (88)</p>
<p>St Louisienne - Seck Boubacar (14)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000.</p>
</text>
